│                                                                                                   │
│   NOTE:  This is a SINGLE-SHOT bound.  Not to be confused with the noisy channel                 │
│          coding theorem (asymptotic, n uses: M ≤ 2^{nC}).                                        │
│                                                                                                   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
